description	"The Tusken Raider

^2Weaponry:
- Gaffi Stick
-- ^7Staff / ^3Yellow ^7/ ^1Red ^7Styles
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (2)
- Tusken Rifle
-- Mag Reload

^6Equipment:
- Medpac (25HP+)
- Advanced Medpac (50HP+)
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Heal (3)
- CTF: 28s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- 3 Poison Darts ^3[CS1 Melee]

^2Strengths^7: Unique Mix of Long Range and Short Range Effectiveness.
^1Weaknesses^7: Weak in Medium range Encounters.

Tusken Warriors, less formally referred to as Sand People or simply as Tuskens, were a culture of nomadic, primitive sapients indigenous to Tatooine, where they were quite hostile to local settlers."